COMMANDS RUN:
 - Skill: {"skill": "tool:skill", "args": "Who owns the code that is still in this repo today? Attribute surviving lines (git blame on current HEAD), not commit counts. Report per-area ownership and any single-maintainer or unmaintained areas."}
