FINAL ANSWER:
**Short answer:** Troy Goode and Douglas Christopher Wilson hold most of the code that survives at HEAD: 72.2% of the 1,662 counted non-blank lines between them.

**Surviving lines at HEAD** (ordered by surviving lines; `--merge-identities`, so the Troy Goode row is merged)

| Author | Lines | Share | Commits | Share | Last commit |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Troy Goode (2 addresses) | 649 | 39.0% | 95 | 30.2% | 2026-04-10 |
| Douglas Christopher Wilson | 551 | 33.2% | 143 | 45.4% | 2021-09-07 |
| Íñigo Marquínez Prado | 80 | 4.8% | 2 | 0.6% | 2024-05-14 |
